{"unit_id":"tag:0FPP:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节刻画复形（complexes）的范畴（category）及导出范畴（derived category）中的可对偶化（dualizable）对象（objects）。特别地，将看到 <MATH_0001> 的对象（object）具有对偶（dual）当且仅当它完美（perfect）（这由例 <REF_0001> 和引理 <REF_0002> 得出）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"dualizable","target_term":"可对偶化"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"本节的输入"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"复形的环境"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"导出对偶的环境"},{"source_term":"dualizable","target_term":"可对偶化","context":"对偶存在的刻画"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"可对偶化的输入"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出对象"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶","context":"与完美性的等价"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美","context":"对偶存在条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPQ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。由 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）组成的复形（complexes）的范畴（category），其张量积（tensor product）定义为\n<MATH_0003>，\n是对称幺半范畴（symmetric monoidal category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积"},{"source_term":"symmetric monoidal category","target_term":"对称幺半范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"幺半范畴的对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"复形环境"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积","context":"幺半运算"},{"source_term":"symmetric monoidal category","target_term":"对称幺半范畴","context":"带符号的张量结构"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPQ:proof","translation":"省略。提示：作为单位（unit）<MATH_0001>，取复形（complex），其中 <MATH_0002> 位于次数（degree）<MATH_0003>，其他次数（degrees）为零，并有显然的同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005>。为证明引理，需要检验各个图（diagrams）的交换性（commutativity），见《范畴（Categories）》定义 <REF_0001> 和 <REF_0002>。每种情形的验证都是直接的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unit","target_term":"单位"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutativity","target_term":"交换性"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unit","target_term":"单位","context":"幺半结构的单位"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"单位的代表"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"单位非零项"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数","context":"其他项"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"单位约束"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图","context":"幺半公理"},{"source_term":"commutativity","target_term":"交换性","context":"幺半公理检验"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节"}],"notes":["原文省略证明并仅给提示，译文保留。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPR:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成，满足对每个 <MATH_0004>，存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使 <MATH_0006> 严格完美（strictly perfect）。考虑复形（complex）\n<MATH_0007>，\n如第 <REF_0001> 节中所述。设\n<MATHSEG_0001>及<MATHSEG_0002>\n分别为 <MATH_0008> 和 <MATH_0009>，其中 <MATH_0010> 和 <MATH_0011> 如《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》例 <REF_0002> 中所述。则 <MATH_0012> 是 <MATH_0013> 的左对偶（left dual），如《范畴（Categories）》定义 <REF_0003> 中所述。省略以下等式的验证：\n<MATH_0014>\n和\n<MATH_0015>。\n请与《代数进阶（More on Algebra）》引理 <REF_0004> 比较。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"strictly perfect","target_term":"严格完美"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"对偶及原对象"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形系数"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部有限投射性"},{"source_term":"strictly perfect","target_term":"严格完美","context":"逐覆盖的条件"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶","context":"显式对偶"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶","context":"引用章节"}],"notes":["仅翻译已验证数学文字槽中的连接词 and 为及，其余数学字节受保护。原文省略对偶等式的验证，译文保留。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPS:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。若 <MATH_0004> 在幺半范畴（monoidal category）中具有左对偶（left dual），其对象为复形（complexes），由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成（《范畴（Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>），则对每个对象（object）<MATH_0006>，属于 <MATH_0007>，都存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008>，使 <MATH_0009> 严格完美（strictly perfect），且左对偶（left dual）如例 <REF_0002> 中所构造。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"monoidal category","target_term":"幺半范畴"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"strictly perfect","target_term":"严格完美"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"对偶输入"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形系数"},{"source_term":"monoidal category","target_term":"幺半范畴","context":"对偶的环境"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶","context":"对偶存在与唯一性"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"幺半范畴的对象"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"局部化对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部结论"},{"source_term":"strictly perfect","target_term":"严格完美","context":"对偶存在的必要条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPS:proof","translation":"由左对偶（left duals）的唯一性（uniqueness）（《范畴（Categories）》评注 <REF_0001>），只要证明 <MATH_0001> 满足所述条件，就得到最后一项断言。设 <MATH_0002> 为左对偶（left dual）。写成 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006>。由于\n<MATH_0007>\n和\n<MATH_0008>，\n由《范畴（Categories）》定义 <REF_0002>，立即可见\n<MATH_0009>\n和\n<MATH_0010>。\n换言之，可见 <MATH_0011> 是 <MATH_0012> 的左对偶（left dual），并且《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0003> 适用于每个 <MATH_0013>。设 <MATH_0014> 为 <MATH_0015> 的对象（object）。存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0016>，使对每个 <MATH_0017>，只有有限（finite）多个 <MATH_0018> 非零。因此，将 <MATH_0019> 替换为 <MATH_0020> 后，可假设只有有限（finite）多个 <MATH_0021> 非零，而由所引用的引理，这意味着只有有限（finite）多个 <MATH_0022> 非零。再次应用该引理，可找到覆盖（covering）<MATH_0023>，使每个 <MATH_0024> 是某个有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0025>-模（module）的直和因子（direct summand），证明完成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"left duals","target_term":"左对偶"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"left duals","target_term":"左对偶","context":"对偶的唯一性"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性","context":"最后一项断言"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"left dual","target_term":"左对偶","context":"逐项的对偶比较"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","contex